meta {
  name: Download outreach tracker
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/forms/outreaches/download/outreachtracker
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

vars:pre-request {
  baseUrl: http://localhost:3000
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  # Download Outreach Tracker (CSV Export)
  
  Exports the entire `outreach_tracker` table as a CSV file download. Selects all rows from the table (no filters, no pagination) and converts the records to CSV using json2csv, and returns the CSV as raw file bytes with Content-Type: text/csv and Content-Disposition: attachment. The response is not JSON; frontend clients should read it as a Blob and trigger a browser download.
  
  ## Authorization
  Requires authentication (`authenticate()`) and `"read"` permission (`authorize("read")`).
  
  ## Request
  No path parameters, query parameters, or request body.
  
  ## Response — `200 OK`
  
  **Content-Type:** `text/csv; charset=utf-8`
  **Content-Disposition:** `attachment; filename="outreach_tracker.csv"`
  
  The CSV contains one row per outreach record with the following columns (in order):
  
  | Column                  | Description                                             |
  |-------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------|
  | `id`                    | UUID primary key                                        |
  | `outreachStartDate`     | Start date of the outreach event                        |
  | `outreachEndDate`       | End date of the outreach event                          |
  | `outreachState`         | Nigerian state where the outreach took place            |
  | `outreachLga`           | Local Government Area                                   |
  | `outreachCity`          | City of the outreach event                              |
  | `outreachCommunity`     | Specific community name                                 |
  | `numVolunteers`         | Number of volunteers involved                           |
  | `numBeneficiaries`      | Number of beneficiaries reached                         |
  | `outreachType`          | Type(s) of outreach activity                            |
  | `activityDescription`   | Description of activities conducted                     |
  | `impactStories`         | Notable impact stories                                  |
  | `challengesEncountered` | Challenges encountered during the outreach              |
  | `recommendations`       | Recommendations for future outreaches                   |
  | `submittedBy`           | Name of the person who submitted the report             |
  | `submissionDate`        | Date the report was submitted                           |
  | `updatedAt`             | Last update timestamp                                   |
  | `createdAt`             | Creation timestamp                                      |
  | `deletedAt`             | Soft-delete timestamp (null if active)                  |
  
  ## Errors
  
  | Status                      | Description                                          |
  |-----------------------------|------------------------------------------------------|
  | `401 Unauthorized`          | Missing or invalid access token / refresh token.     |
  | `403 Forbidden`             | User lacks the `"read"` permission.                  |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Unexpected server error.                             |
}
